| topic                                        | command / remark                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| binary must be generated using gcc -g option | \-g2, -g3, -ggdb for having more debugging symbols like macro expansion                                                                                                                                |
|                                              |                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| gbd ./executableName                         |                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| help                                         | show help about gdb commands                                                                                                                                                                           |
| r                                            | run                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
| quit                                         | terminate the execution of program                                                                                                                                                                     |
| where                                        | show the position where the execution crashes                                                                                                                                                          |
| List linenumber                              | print out some lines from the source code around linenumber                                                                                                                                            |
| list functionName                            | print out lines of function in source code                                                                                                                                                             |
| info source                                  | show info about current source file                                                                                                                                                                    |
|                                              |                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| print variable                               | show the value of a variable                                                                                                                                                                           |
| p \* pointer                                 | print the value of pointer                                                                                                                                                                             |
| p /x I                                       | show I as hexadecimal                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| info locals                                  | show the value of all local variables in current execution                                                                                                                                             |
| p main::variable                             | if we are in a local function only its local variables are in default scope, to access a variable of a caller function we should specify that caller function (main is the caller of a local function) |
| set var variable = 1                         | set the value of variable to 1                                                                                                                                                                         |
| set var main.cpp::globalVarName = 1          | set the value of global variable to 1                                                                                                                                                                  |
|                                              |                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| bt                                           | show backtrace of stack (the sequence of caller functions from main until the actual function containing the breakpoint)                                                                               |
| f                                            | show current stack frame (function)                                                                                                                                                                    |
| info args                                    | show information about the function arguments corresponding to the current stack frame                                                                                                                 |
|                                              |                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| break 10                                     |                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| break foo.cpp:10                             | break at line 10 of foo.cpp                                                                                                                                                                            |
| break foo.cpp:foo                            | break when entering in foo function in foo.cpp file                                                                                                                                                    |
| info break                                   | show breakpoints and their positions                                                                                                                                                                   |
| clear 10                                     | clear breakpoint in line 10                                                                                                                                                                            |
| clear foo                                    | clear breakpoint in function foo                                                                                                                                                                       |
|                                              |                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| c                                            | continue execution after breakpoint                                                                                                                                                                    |
| s                                            | step into one line                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| s 3                                          | step three lines in                                                                                                                                                                                    |
| n                                            | next (like step over not in)                                                                                                                                                                           |
| finish                                       | finish current function, loop, etc                                                                                                                                                                     |
| Condition 1 expr                             | stop in breakpoint 1 only if expression expr is satisfied                                                                                                                                              |
|                                              |                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| ulimit -c unlimited                          | activate generating coredump file when crashing                                                                                                                                                        |
| gdb a.exe core.ProcessID                     | open the core dump “core.ProcessID” of a.exe crash using gdb                                                                                                                                           |
|                                              |                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| manual                                       | [https://sourceware.org/gdb/documentation/](https://sourceware.org/gdb/documentation/)                                                                                                                 |
